<name>Hong Dae</name>
<description><![CDATA[Two Hongdae walks: the Gyeongui Line Forest Park (Yeontral Park → Book Street → Seogang sky bridge, green) and the Red Road busking street from Hongik Univ. Station down to the Han River (red). Lines from Naver Map's official courses.]]></description>
